  "description": "Nam Gun-min has been having vivid, X-rated dreams almost every night for the past week. These aren’t your run of the mill, typical sexy dreams filled with hot women. No, these dreams keep featuring Jeong Hu, a close sunbae who Gun-min previously had zero sexual attraction to. Gun-min manages to wake up in the middle of one of these torturous dreams only to find real man at the end of his bed. To make matters worse, that man isn’t even Jeong Hu, but the strange underclassman he had just met earlier that night, only now he's dressed like a devil. Why does he look so....good? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US) \n\n*Note: Includes two extra chapters.*",
